    "scope": "Reviewed dagger, Sazabi, Infinity, trap-claw, Enchant-prebuff, shared Smite Treachery and four rare caster-circlet roles; remaining build families pending. Includes separate Standard/Max Enchant magic circlets. Ten source-specific rare boot candidates added; no universal market-price inference. Eight class-skill/Knockback/Crushing Blow glove roles added. Ten magic/crafted Sorceress amulet roles across starter, standard, MF, hybrid and Enchant-prebuff setups. Six rare-ring profiles for Lightning, Nova and Blizzard variants. Ten plain/life/FHR Grand Charm roles across six builds. Twelve completed Insight mercenary roles; conflicted Blizzard Standard and conditional Set alternatives deferred. Three Tal Rasha player roles preserve the Lightning Magic Find set companions and armor socket requirement. Eight magic/rare survival and Gold Find belt candidates, with source-specific roll targets. Eight crafted caster/Blood belt candidates with per-build roll and loadout conditions. Twenty-five explicit small-charm combinations across five builds and their variants. Seven source-specific IAS/resistance socket-jewel roles with recipient and wearer conditions. Thirteen documented Naj teleport-swap alternatives plus a distinct Fal-socketed Poison Nova budget planner role; availability remains conditional on charges and equipment requirements. Four explicit magic/rare Teleport-charge staff/amulet alternatives for Berserk and Poison Nova; skill-aware availability checks do not infer prices. Six Starter charged-utility roles: Lower Resist for Blizzard/Fire Warlock/Lightning Fury, Life Tap for Smite, and Teleport for Fire Warlock/Lightning Fury; inventory and weapon-swap roles remain distinct. Eight Lower Resist/Life Tap wand roles across five builds, preserving Starter/Budget/Ubers placement and alternative curse-source conditions. Thirteen variant-specific Teleport staff roles across twelve builds, including separate FoH/Holy Bolt starters, inventory-only travel and Enigma alternatives. Ten Cunning/Berserker/Venomous circlet and amulet roles with native skill-tab/class and secondary-affix requirements. Twelve empty Jeweler Monarch of Deflecting preparation roles; facet/Ist payload requirements remain separate. Ten empty magic helmet/armor socket-base alternatives with native capacity/suffix checks and perfect suffix preferences. Lightning Fury Starter magic Matriarchal Javelin skill/40-IAS candidate with +6 skill preference and full-loadout condition. Mirrored Blades Starter Rhyme Grimoire and empty two-socket preparation preserve three native skill bonuses and recipe state. Two Double Throw Starter crafted Balanced Axe roles preserve planner skill/IAS/damage/leech/life combination, cold exclusion and dual-hand placement. Two Double Throw Starter Cruel elite magic throwing-weapon alternatives cover nine verified unrestricted elite bases with native ED range and cold exclusion. Two Double Throw ethereal rare throwing-weapon planner targets preserve exact high-roll examples, native quantity replenishment and Amplify Damage; lower-roll viability remains separate. Five slot-specific Double Throw rare imbue examples preserve axe resistance, knife mana leech/proc and main-hand harpoon life leech. Two Fire Warlock Ars Al'Diabolos off-hand candidates preserve Standard Um and Magic Find Ist sockets, native Chaos/FCR/fire/Apocalypse bonuses and full-loadout conditions. Echoing Ubers Hellwarden's Will preserves Guardian's Light socket and Sling/Renewed Black Cleft dependencies. Two Dragon Talon Budget player Cannot Be Frozen alternatives preserve Kira's Guardian/Duriel's Shell slot tradeoffs and complete-loadout requirements. Ten Angelic amulet/ring roles across five reviewed Starter/Budget builds retain player companions and exact one/two-ring setup multiplicity; planner-only Mirrored Blades remains unreviewed. Thirteen starter set roles preserve three Sigon combinations, Budget Enchant Death's pair, and two Death's Guard upgrade paths; helmet payload and player companions stay conditional. Dragon Talon Budget Guillaume helmet preserves combined IAS/lightning-resistance properties on one jewel. Four Demon Limb Enchant prebuff roles cover Echoing Standard/Ubers, Strafe Standard and Dream Ubers, preserving charge availability and the Strafe Lava Gout alternative. Hydra Standard fire Rainbow Facet demand accepts3/3 rolls with5/5 preferences; recipient and105FCR loadout remain conditional. Seven source-specific farming mercenary helmets: Stealskull in three Magic Find variants and upgraded Crown of Thieves in four Gold Find variants; exact rune and loadout requirements retained. Six Vampire Gaze mercenary roles preserve three Rogue compound IAS/all-resistance jewels, two Frenzy Um sockets and the Lightning Sorceress Uber Mephisto restriction. Six explicit Fissure Starter mercenary alternatives retain early progression and completed recipe requirements."
